# Line endings — this repo is deliberately ALL LF, on every platform.
#
# Verified 2026-09-13: `git ls-files --eol` reports 396 files `i/lf` and ZERO CRLF,
# so adding this file renormalises nothing (no churn, no mass diff). His PowerShell
# scripts (rkm-cinema.ps1, bootstrap.ps1, scripts/*.ps1) already run correctly as LF
# on PowerShell 5.1 — which is why there is deliberately NO `*.ps1 eol=crlf` rule
# here: it would only rewrite four working files for no benefit.
#
# The Apple work makes this explicit rather than accidental: the agent authors on
# Windows/Linux, the build happens on macOS, and an injected CRLF is the classic way
# to break a shell script with "bad interpreter: /bin/sh^M".
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.icns binary
*.mp4  binary
*.m4v  binary
*.mov  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.ttc  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
